    "q-107497": {
      "dom_id": "step-q107497",
      "name": "Question 11",
      "problem": "Consider the LU decomposition of the matrix $A$ and the vector $b,$ given by\n\n$$\nA={{[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 9 & 1\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{L}{{[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 6\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{U},\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIf $⟨{x}_{1},{x}_{2}⟩$ and $⟨{y}_{1},{y}_{2}⟩$ are the solutions to the systems $Ax=b$ and $Ly=b$ respectively, what is the value of ${x}_{2}\\cdot {y}_{1}?$",
      "worked_solution": "First, notice that since $A=LU,$ we can write\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax=b\\,⟹\\,{{(LU)}_{⏟}}_{A}x=b.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, setting $Ux=y,$ we obtain\n\n$$\nL{{(Ux)}_{⏟}}_{y}=b\\,⟹\\,\\{\\begin{aligned}Ly=b \\\\ Ux=y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we solve the two systems in turn.\n\n- First, we solve $Ly=b.$ Writing this equation in matrix form, we get\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 9 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1} \\\\ {y}_{2}\\end{aligned}]=b=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThis gives the system of equations\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1}=1 \\\\ 9{y}_{1}+{y}_{2}=6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution to this system is ${y}_{1}=1$ and ${y}_{2}=-3.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\ny=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n- Next, we solve $Ux=y.$ Writing this equation in matrix form, we get\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 6\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]=y=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThis gives the system of equations\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}=1 \\\\ 6{x}_{2}=-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution to this system is ${x}_{2}=-\\frac{1}{2}$ and ${x}_{1}=-2.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFinally, ${x}_{2}\\cdot {y}_{1}=(-\\frac{1}{2})\\cdot 1=-\\frac{1}{2}.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-107497-a",
